<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div></section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container prose">
    <p>{{ site.legalName }} ("we", "us") is committed to protecting your personal information. This policy explains what we collect through this website and how we use it.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you submit our enquiry form we collect the details you provide: your name, company, email address, phone number, site location and the content of your message.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>We use these details only to respond to your enquiry, prepare quotations and deliver any services you request. We do not sell your information or use it for unrelated marketing without your consent.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep enquiry details only for as long as needed to deal with your enquiry. Where you become a customer, records are kept for as long as needed to meet our contractual, legal and regulatory obligations (for example F-Gas record keeping).</p>
    <h2>Who processes it</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are processed by our website host, Netlify, Inc., and forwarded to our business email. Both act on our instructions.</p>
    <h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
    <p>When you first visit, we ask whether you accept cookies. We only set non-essential cookies if you click <strong>Accept</strong>.</p>
    <p><strong>If you accept:</strong> Google Ads and Google Analytics cookies (set by Google through Google Tag Manager) are used to measure how many visitors and enquiries come from our adverts and to improve our advertising. Google acts as an independent controller for this data; see Google's privacy policy at policies.google.com/privacy.</p>
    <p><strong>If you reject:</strong> no advertising or analytics cookies are stored. The Google tag still sends a basic, cookieless signal (for example, that a page was viewed or an enquiry was sent) so we can count enquiries from our adverts; this does not store anything on your device.</p>
    <p>We store your choice in your browser so we don't ask on every page. You can change your mind at any time using the <button type="button" class="cookie-link" data-cookie-settings>Cookie settings</button> link at the bottom of every page.</p>
    <p>Embedded third-party content (such as the Cyber Essentials certificate widget and Google Fonts) may be loaded from those providers' servers.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under UK GDPR you can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you. Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>. You also have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ico.org.uk).</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
